cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite H2sim when using this software, record the source revision, and cite the
  model-specific publications and database sources used in your study.
title: "H2sim: Underground hydrogen storage simulation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ahmed
    given-names: Elyes
  - family-names: Raynaud
    given-names: Xavier
repository-code: "https://github.com/sintefmath/h2-sim"
url: "https://sintefmath.github.io/h2-sim/"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  MATLAB tools built on MRST for hydrogen storage in saline aquifers and depleted
  gas reservoirs, including black-oil and compositional flow, microbial
  reactions, thermodynamics, and sequential PHREEQC coupling.
keywords:
  - underground hydrogen storage
  - MATLAB
  - MRST
  - reactive transport
  - PHREEQC
